  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution of Greece in support of the South Sudan crisis response plan 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The healthcare situation in South Sudan is critical, with ongoing conflict, displacement, and limited access to essential services. Millions of people, including internally displaced persons (IDPs), returnees, and vulnerable host communities, continue to face significant health risks, including high mortality rates, the spread of preventable diseases, and insufficient maternal and child health services. IOM South Sudan&#x2019;s health response strategy is designed to address these challenges and improve healthcare access for those most in need.</narrative>
  </description>
